1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,540
Edit the entry point, and open the Hours card.

2
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:09,967
The Business hours calendar says when it is open.

3
00:00:09,967 --> 00:00:12,211
Left empty, it is always open.

4
00:00:12,211 --> 00:00:14,890
Here it follows the weekday calendar.

5
00:00:15,385 --> 00:00:20,067
Closed action says what happens to a call that arrives while closed.

6
00:00:20,067 --> 00:00:22,788
Hold in queue keeps the call waiting.

7
00:00:22,788 --> 00:00:24,813
Voicemail takes a message.

8
00:00:24,813 --> 00:00:27,407
Overflow sends it to another queue.

9
00:00:27,407 --> 00:00:29,115
Reject ends the call.

10
00:00:29,569 --> 00:00:32,517
Pick Voicemail, and write a Closed message.

11
00:00:32,517 --> 00:00:37,029
It is spoken to the caller first, and then the closed action applies.

